🎯 Mission Statement
Build a central AI‑driven mission conductor that unifies all major systems of the HYPERFOCUS ZONE empire. It should scan Chief Lyndz’s current focus, energy and available time, automatically prioritise tasks and rituals, bridge all existing systems and deliver ADHD‑friendly, dopamine‑boosted feedback. Every action must be logged in the Memory Crystals and the orchestrator must proactively heal or alert if any subsystem is stuck.

This document outlines the architecture, key components, data flows and integration points required to implement the orchestrator.

🏗️ Architecture Overview
The orchestrator sits at the heart of the empire’s AI Integration Layer. It acts as the conductor, coordinating the BROski♾️ Automatic COO, ARIA Intelligence, the Agent Army, the Memory Crystals, Discord Bot, Boardroom rituals, Family orchestrator, and other services listed in the repository’s showcase
