.

Key modules
State Scanner – gathers real‑time information about Chief Lyndz’s current focus area, energy level and time available via prompts or health sensors. This module may also query other services (e.g. sleep trackers, calendars) to refine the estimate.

Task Collector – pulls outstanding tasks, missions and rituals from multiple sources:

Memory Crystals: persistent store of missions and logs; tasks are categorised by project, priority and estimated energy/time.

Boardroom & Team Sync: meeting agendas, sprints, cross‑team commitments.

Family Orchestrator: personal/family tasks, self‑care reminders.

BROski♾️ COO: high‑level strategic objectives and operations tasks
GitHub
.

AI Planner (ARIA) – uses ARIA’s decision engine to analyse the tasks and produce an optimal mission plan given the current focus, energy and time constraints. It evaluates urgency, impact, dependencies and dopamine potential to rank tasks.

Agent Dispatcher – selects and deploys specialised agents from the Agent Army (677+ automation agents)
GitHub
. Agents may include code writers, documenters, testers, family bots, or healers. It orchestrates them concurrently using asynchronous calls.

Ritual Trigger – coordinates rituals and ceremonies (boardroom stand‑ups, team sync, family check‑ins) and ensures they fit into the schedule. Uses the boardroom APIs to align teams and update status.

Feedback Engine – delivers ADHD‑friendly, dopamine‑optimised feedback via Discord or terminal:

Real‑time progress updates and countdowns.

Gamified rewards (BROski$ currency, XP, badges) and celebratory memes or GIFs.

Immediate celebrations for small wins.

Encouraging reminders if focus or energy drops.

Healing & Escalation – monitors the health of integrated systems; if a service crashes or becomes unresponsive, the orchestrator attempts an auto‑heal (restart, fallback), taking inspiration from the empire’s immortal architecture
GitHub
. If auto‑heal fails, it escalates to Chief or a human operator.

Memory Crystal Sync – records every step of the orchestration: input state, mission plan, dispatched agents, progress, feedback and final outcomes. Logs are stored in a structured JSON format and appended to the Memory Crystal path specified in configuration (MEMORY_CRYSTAL_PATH
GitHub
).

